 StandardForm_WithParent;parms;n;globalParms
⍝ Presents a standard form with a status bar wich also contains a version number
 globalParms←##.GUI.APLGuiGlobalParms.CreateDefaults
 globalParms.regKey←'MyApp'
 globalParms.caption←'My App'
 globalParms.icon←⎕NEW'Icon'(⊂'File'(GetFile'Sample.ico'))
 globalParms.centerIn←⎕NEW'Form'(('Coord' 'Pixel')('Posn'(200 300))('Size'(400 600)))
 globalParms.parent←⍬←globalParms.centerIn

 parms←##.GUI.StdForm.CreateParms
 parms.caption←'MyForm'
 :If ⍬ ⍬≡parms.size
     parms.size200 400
 :EndIf
 parms.minSize←100 200
 n←##.GUI.StdForm.Create globalParms parms
 n.VersionNo.Text←1⊃##.GUI.APLGuiAdmin.Version

 n.∆Form.Wait
 n.∆CloseForm
 :Trap 0
     2 ⎕NQ globalParms.parent'Close'
 :EndTrap
⍝Done
